DCCE CCF1F2           (    forth6809.asm):03101                     LDD   #STOREW
DCD1 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03102                     PSHU  D
DCD3 BDE83E           (    forth6809.asm):03103                     JSR   CCALL
DCD6 39               (    forth6809.asm):03104                     RTS
DCD7 3710             (    forth6809.asm):03105         TOIMMED:    PULU  X                 ; a-addr of the value cell
