DD4B 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03175                     PSHU  D
DD4D BDDB27           (    forth6809.asm):03176                     JSR   CODECOMMA
DD50 DC0A             (    forth6809.asm):03177                     LDD   VARHERE
DD52 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03178                     PSHU  D
DD54 BDDB27           (    forth6809.asm):03179                     JSR   CODECOMMA
