E967 CC0106           (    forth6809.asm):05482         TIBW:       LDD   #TIBBUF
E96A 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05483                     PSHU  D
E96C 39               (    forth6809.asm):05484                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):05485         
                      (    forth6809.asm):05486         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
